# Container Runtime (CRI / containerd) Diagnostics

Troubleshoot the underlying container runtime when pods fail to start or the node reports `NotReady`.

## Common Commands

```bash
# 1. Inspect containerd daemon status
sudo systemctl status containerd

# 2. View containerd journal logs
sudo journalctl -u containerd -e --no-pager

# 3. Use crictl CLI for container inspections
sudo crictl pods
sudo crictl ps -a
sudo crictl images
sudo crictl info

# 4. Inspect container log files directly on filesystem
ls -l /var/log/pods/
sudo tail -n 50 /var/log/containers/<pod-name>*.log
```
